license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/ZacharyChappell/synthetic-workshop"
url: "https://github.com/ZacharyChappell/synthetic-workshop"
abstract: "synthetic-workshop is a Python package for constructing analytic synthetic 2D and 3D image scenes with known geometry, object masks, scalar fields, centrelines, frames, topology, composition metadata, plotting outputs, and export-ready arrays and tables for image-method validation."
